d. The follow-up wording correction in PR #930 (head `9785b8efd3ccfad77c4e077ac14f4a7964b33e1a`) merged as `007c9fc892568e9a1375662caee0db13a800b102`; its exact-head checks passed, and post-merge CI (`46102061647`) and CodeQL (`46102061586`) passed on the merge commit. The advisory Entire check was neutral and was not a required gate. The plan's G-1 also names `make test` at the exact head; that command was not run for `0977932`, so this report does not mark that additional gate complete. The earlier v1.3.0 measurements below are historical and are not v1.3.1 qualification evidence.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\nconst r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git diff --check; git diff --stat; git diff -- docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md | head -30\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-postmerge-closure\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":900}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a2208e-347b-7f62-bb1f-c24475a2832b","create_time":1795846426.4642146}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":138327,"sampled_through_sequence":138325,"client_authored":false}}
