{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T06:44:18.052Z","ordinal":314950,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a2208e-347b-7f62-bb1f-c24475a2832b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_033f353a673dbf89016b0a783f0b2887d293667c42e0f0487f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The context maturity paperwork is complete and merged in [PR #935](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/935).\n\nThe report now records PR #911’s merge head `2c300c9` and PR #930’s merge and verification results. PR #935 merged as `b3f37c5`; its post-merge CI (`46116988341`) and CodeQL (`46116988355`) both passed. The approved claim was archived, and the earlier paperwork worktree was preserved.\n\nThe repository and both paperwork worktrees are clean. One local `make test` command was accidentally started while preparing the PR description; I interrupted it during compilation, so it produced no test result and is not counted as verification. The hosted checks passed."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":160,"started_at_ms":1795848255060,"completed_at_ms":1795848258052}}
