{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T06:45:02.746Z","ordinal":314997,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a220e6-7099-7843-8178-dc47d6856c21","call_id":"call_899bd5b2b1e04be59609138b2fb75f2a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 7.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"id\":\"140885823517\",\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 4356)\\nTotal output lines: 100\\n\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:16.2027501Z ✔ batch validation accepts the existing operation specification and preserves dependencies (2.806634ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:16.2031752Z ✔ batch validation rejects dependency cycles before execution (0.470848ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:16.2039382Z ✔ batch validation rejects unrecognized fields rather than silently ignoring them (0.28407ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:16.2044494Z ✔ ordinary batch files cannot silently discard approved-plan checks (0.517766ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:16.6869794Z ✔ durable operation state preserves unknown outcome through recovery (40.646205ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:17.1338231Z ✔ credential store writes are private, atomic and synced (9.176456ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:17.1340921Z ✔ workspace trust writes are private, atomic and synced (3.691135ms)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\\t2026-11-28T06:11:17.4416887Z ▶ PLAN-08 PR-8c: Audit log rotation (REQ-PER-102, ACC-PER-06)\\ntest-shard (22, 1)\\tRun one shard of the CLI suite with a hang bound\