{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T08:27:13.370Z","ordinal":317793,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a22128-3667-7142-a098-5707fbe8c197","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_033f353a673dbf89016b0a905e037487d2a70fc2b013948946","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The context-maturity paperwork is reconciled: the old claim was archived, its worktree and local files were preserved, and the report records the verified merge head `2c300c9`.\n\nI also continued the approved P10-02 work. [PR #937](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/937) adds a crash test for a completed file write whose journal completion record was not saved. The focused suite passed **3/3**, and TypeScript checking passed.\n\nThe first hosted CI run had one unrelated failure in `upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts:813`. Its focused rerun passed locally on Node 24; hosted CI is rerunning the failed shard. I left the PR open and unmerged pending that result. The other required checks passed.\n\nThe main checkout is clean. The PR worktree is clean at commit `00dc078`."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":182,"started_at_ms":1795854430037,"completed_at_ms":1795854433370}}
