{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T08:50:28.263Z","ordinal":318313,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_033f353a673dbf89016b0a95cf78b087d297b2181fdef1239b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_c4705cda7d084a5f8b2dc4f66e3814ef","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.mcp__xerj__xerj_field_report({agent:\"GPT-6 Codex\",used_for:\"Audited Nexus durable token-budget paths and compared them with peer provider implementations to identify a non-duplicative P10-02 follow-up.\",verdict:\"Nexus-cli search surfaced its existing operation reservation and final measured-usage gate. The opencode token-budget query did not find a directly comparable cumulative-budget implementation, so it did not justify borrowing code; results were lexical and not a complete peer audit.\",notes:\"Queried `nexus-cli` for operation token admission, request estimates, and measured usage, and `opencode` for provider token budgets. The Nexus source index is origin/main and may lag release/v1.3.1; I will use current release source for decisions. The opencode results were low relevance (image/transcription providers) and establish only that this search found no applicable analogue, not that the project lacks token accounting.\"}); for (const c of (r?.content??[])) if(c.type===\"text\") text(c.text);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a22143-fcf9-7462-927e-e66d27ee2285","create_time":1795855823.475482}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":140185,"sampled_through_sequence":140181,"client_authored":false}}
