{"timestamp":"2026-11-28T09:19:50.109Z","ordinal":319113,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f090-96c7-7f02-ae7d-1a090d633b76","turn_id":"01a22143-fcf9-7462-927e-e66d27ee2285","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_033f353a673dbf89016b0a9cb3519c87d2ae1d825827be418c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Outstanding right now:\n\n- PR #939 (`edit_file` crash-recovery coverage) still needs its full Node 22/24 test shards and Linux build to finish. CodeQL and the test-gate jobs passed.\n- If those checks pass, I’ll merge #939 at its exact tested head and wait for CI and CodeQL on the resulting release commit.\n- Then I’ll record the post-merge evidence and release the related work claims.\n\nThat would complete this selected crash-recovery slice. The broader P10-02 plan will still have unproven areas—other side-effect types, host or power loss, and provider-enforced token limits—so I’ll keep those marked incomplete rather than treating this test as full recovery assurance."}],"phase":"commentary"},"content_token_count":150,"started_at_ms":1795857587344,"completed_at_ms":1795857590109}}
