ed separate evidence.\n79:**Progress (2026-11-27, merged PR #919):** Session history archive writes enforce an aggregate cap equal to the existing 2 GiB retained-state ceiling. `SessionManager.assertSessionArchiveCapacity` scans archive files under the existing state-store guard, rejects unreadable/non-regular entries and scans above 100,000 entries, and refuses a write before archive append or fork creation if it would cross the cap. It preserves existing archives and does not add another cleanup or admission framework. The new `session_archive_bounds.test.ts` covers aggregate accounting across sessions, byte preservation on refusal, fork refusal before state creation, inability to raise the ceiling through options, and empty append behavior at a full quota. With the worktree-local Rust core built, `session_archive_bounds.test.ts`, `session_fork.test.ts`, and `compaction_continuity.test.ts` passed **43/43** on Node 24.11.1 (exit 0); process-death recovery cases and the existing archive-write failure case were included. After the final empty-append guard, the current archive and fork suites passed **10/10**, `npm --prefix cli run build` passed, and `git diff --check` passed. PR #919 merged at `2026-11-27T20:00:55Z` as `a944a4eac448fdd1b08f1adfdca5be5696376ad2`. Required PR-head CI run `46059219684` and CodeQL run `46059219707` passed at exact PR head `d1778581428312574f24057e5b2741e6d3aae802`. Post-merge CI run `46060674463` passed both Node test gates, all eight shards, Linux packaging, and diff coverage; CodeQL run `46060674335` also passed on the exact merge commit. Entire Gates failed on the PR head but is advisory and excluded from required merge gates by project policy. Scope is limited to `*.history.jsonl` archives written by participating current-version Nexus processes; this is not a general disk quota and does not cap other state, external writers, or older running versions. **WP-P10-04 remains partially open** for the broader CPU/memory, session-count, provider-accounting, and cleanup/recovery gaps above.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a22143-fcf9-7462-927e-e66d27ee2285","create_time":1795861042.661421}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":141074,"sampled_through_sequence":141071,"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
