`, PR head `a76b414c120e3342ff638a0b4f8cf8cd707fad55`); all eight Node 22/24 shards, both matrices, Linux, and JavaScript/TypeScript passed. Entire Gates failed as an advisory check. PR #939 merged as `b764b753926759650f971ba41823b9e631305db2`; post-merge CI run `46130593983` and CodeQL run `46130593979` passed on that exact commit. This expands process-crash evidence to two filesystem mutation tools; it still does not demonstrate host/power-loss behavior, exactly-once execution, or unknown-outcome recovery for other side-effect classes. **WP-P10-02 remains incomplete.**\n \n+**Filesystem side-effect crash follow-up (merged PR #941):** The same harness now covers Rust `delete_file`, and the recovery assertion requires exactly one tool result so a repeated dispatch cannot be hidden by the file already being absent. Node 22.22.2 and Node 24.11.1 each passed the focused crash-recovery file 5/5; `npm --prefix cli run build` and `git diff --check` passed. An initial Node 22 run exposed that the harness's 10-second polling bound was too short under local load; increasing that test-only wait to 20 seconds allowed the full suite to pass on both runtimes. Required PR checks and CodeQL passed at PR head `d67f6b68d1fb480104d1b1ca7cdba4118c5f82a1` and merge candidate `3d857e96c7541bbb5f1300185494273ad6e4fbbd` (base `d9fec1838bf374927792ac560a10d29087bfd94a`); all Node 22/24 gates and shards, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed. Entire Gates failed as an advisory check. PR #941 merged as `a797ff11ae6dc0feac942e2d739612d21e9a3c15`; post-merge CI run `46136645746` and CodeQL run `46136645782` passed on that exact commit. The three selected file tools now have process-crash coverage; this does not establish host/power-loss recovery, exactly-once execution, or recovery for every side-effect class. **WP-P10-02 remains incomplete.**\n+\n ## WP-P10-03 — Acceptance evidence integrity and export\n \n **Priority:** P1 · **Complexity:** M · **Dependencies:** none for local evidence integrity; independent policy identity remains unavailable under WP-P10-01.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":955733867}},"started_at_ms":1795863475457,"completed_at_ms":1795863477413}}
